WEBVTT

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:30.110
<i>Let's chase our dreams...</i>

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:35.250
<i>... holding hearts burning...</i>

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:39.650
<i>... like the summer sunshine.</i>

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:43.590
<i>If we have courage...</i>

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:46.760
<i>... at 100 miles an hour...</i>

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:54.860
<i>... l'm sure the door will open.</i>

00:01:54.970 --> 00:02:01.950
<i>Since sadness is the road</i>
<i>that leads to smiles...</i>

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:10.650
<i>... dull, dingy shoes will</i>
<i>start to shine, too.</i>

00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:17.350
<i>The most wonderful dream</i>
<i>in the world...</i>

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:24.060
<i>The poundingbeat speeds up.</i>

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:31.230
<i>The eyes are prisms that</i>
<i>catch the wind...</i>

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:39.080
<i>... and in the voices of</i>
<i>countless friends...</i>

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:45.960
<i>... I feel happiness.</i>

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:54.790
Regarding the matter at hand,
I hope to hear from you soon.

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:58.660
Understood, Sir. I'll look
into it right away.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:17.110
Oh, could you unload your Moto-Compo?
I'm going to check it out after lunch.

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:18.650
Riiight...

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:20.090
Look, you couldn't
help it!

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:22.520
The GSX has a lot more power
than your Moto-Compo.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:29.720
Right, why don't we go and have a
chat with the folks at the DMV?

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:37.910
At the very least, your
license is history!

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:40.740
Nakajima, thanks!
I owe you one!

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:45.040
Don't mention it... I happened to be
in the neighborhood. Lucky, eh?

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:46.310
You're a big help.

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:48.510
Oh, working hard, I see!

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:52.480
Where's Tsujimoto?

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.750
Huh? Natsumi is right h...

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:56.830
Huh?!

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:01.830
Oh, gee, am I bummed!

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:04.830
That Miyuki... All she said was,
"You couldn't help it!"

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:08.370
Don't you think that was
uncalled for? 'Cause...

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:14.200
...my Moto-Compo makes up for its lack
of power with superior maneuverability!

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:15.180
Doesn't it, Oshou?

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:18.220
If the race always goes to the biggest
and fastest, then we're history!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.050
It really sucks big time!

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.380
'Cause we won't be able
to make enough busts!

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:25.610
In other words, you're jealous
of the White Bike Troopers.

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:36.430
Eh? I didn't know you'd been
adopted by the Temple...

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:45.440
Hmm..."Jealous," eh?
Maybe I am.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:49.940
But, what really pisses me off is the way
Miyuki tried to make me feel better!

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:54.950
Isn't that called "defeatism?"
Isn't it?

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:00.620
Thank you very much
for the tea...

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:03.520
...and for listening to me spill my
guts. I feel much better, Oshou!

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:05.660
Well, I'm glad.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:07.760
Hello!

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.100
Long time no see, Sir.

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:10.470
Long time no see, Sir.
Chief!

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:13.290
My! You haven't
changed a bit!

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:17.100
Why don't you have a seat, and
I'll get you a cup of tea.

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:19.170
Er... You know Oshou?

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.740
Uh-huh. He's my mentor.

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:22.400
M... Mentor?!

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:25.570
He was a policeman for many
years. Also, he's my uncle.

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:28.410
Eh? Your uncle?!

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:33.050
Excuse me...
Chief?

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:40.400
Sheesh! I keep telling him, "Let me
know when the guest leaves!"

00:05:47.270 --> 00:05:47.970
A Female...

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:49.460
A Female...
...White Bike Trooper?!

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:50.800
You want ME to be one?!

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:53.000
That's right. If you'd rather recommend
someone else, then I'll consider it...

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:56.480
...but I can't think of anyone better
qualified than you, Tsujimoto.

00:05:56.650 --> 00:05:58.670
I'll do it! I'll do it! Please,
let me do it!

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:02.880
Is that so? In that case, I'll send my
recommendation to Headquarters.

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:03.780
Headquarters?!

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:06.690
Yes... you'll be reporting
to Headquarters.

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:09.650
Wh... Then, I'll have
to transfer?

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:14.160
I'm not asking you to give me
a definite answer right now.

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:15.790
Why don't you take your time
and think it over?

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:17.830
"Take my time?"

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.440
If you can let me know your decision by
the end of the week, that'll be fine.

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:24.440
B... By the end
of the week?

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:40.350
Natsumi!

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:41.650
Er... Yes?

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:44.920
Lunch break was over
five minutes ago!

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:47.760
But, never mind that... Come
and check this out.

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:52.530
I've been tinkering with the Moto-Compo.
It should burn a little different...

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:53.730
Wh... What for?

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:55.840
I thought that it could use
a little more power.

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:07.020
Natsumi...

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:07.720
What is it?

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:10.690
What is it?
I'm sorry about what I said earlier.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.410
It was very inconsiderate of me...

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:13.580
Is that why you were working
on the bike?

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:17.720
Yes, but wouldn't you want to keep
it in top condition all the time?

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.370
Oh! Natsumi!

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.870
Wh... Wh... What
did I say?!

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:29.970
"Wakaba Preschool"
"School Play"

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:32.440
Be sure to come see us perform
"The Rocky Mountain!"

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:32.480
"Wakaba Preschool"
"School Play"

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:34.640
I'll be the mischievous Tanuki.

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:35.940
I'm the Old Man!

00:07:36.110 --> 00:07:38.280
I'm the Old Lady!

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:40.080
I'm the Bunny!

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:41.280
I'm Soup!

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:48.350
S... Sorry. I can't make
it this time.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:52.520
What?! Why?!

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:06.270
Alright!

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.860
Maybe tomorrow...

00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:45.170
I don't feel like I've
eaten anything.

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:49.550
It seems like my appetite gets worse
every day. What a bummer...

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:01.930
Ah. So that's how it is?

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:03.690
All I can tell you is this...

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:06.100
It's far better to try something
and regret it...

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:08.900
...than to not try something
and regret that...

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:12.100
Chances like this come to you
only if you make them...

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:15.840
...and you have to make the best
of them when you get them.

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:17.340
You're right.

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:19.070
Want me to tell
her for you?

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:24.080
Nah.

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:27.750
I'll tell her myself.
If I were Miyuki...

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:30.090
...l'd wanna be told
directly, I'm sure.

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:32.590
I figured you'd
say that.

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:37.830
Miyuki also wants to be told directly
how you feel about her, Nakajima!

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.860
Wh... Why are you bringing
that up?!

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:43.030
'Cause, if I do become
a Trooper...

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:46.340
...then I won't be a member of
Bokuto Precinct, remember?

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:49.210
I won't be able to solve all your
problems long-distance!

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:04.130
Don't you care, Miyuki?

00:10:04.230 --> 00:10:05.860
If you don't do anything,
she'll leave!

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:07.490
I know all about it,
you know!

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:09.590
How you busted your butt making
a dossier on Natsumi...

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:13.660
...when you first heard that she'd
be transferring to our station!

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:16.740
And how, on her first day, you
even went out to pick her up!

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.810
I remember you said, "Oh, that Natsumi!
She's so late getting here!"

00:10:19.980 --> 00:10:22.070
It's done!

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.820
Aw, c'mon, Miyuki!

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:29.940
Umm... Miyuki? Can I
talk to you for a sec?

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:33.480
Here you go!

00:10:34.930 --> 00:10:35.990
What's this?

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:37.550
What's this?
A Going-Away Present for you.

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.800
You'll be living in
the dorm, right?

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:43.300
That alarm clock is guaranteed
to prevent oversleeping!

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:45.930
How... How long have
you known?

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:49.440
Since you went out to lunch
by yourself at the temple.

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:51.800
You're cruel... You should've
said something.

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:52.940
Maybe you're right.

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:56.770
Hey, I bet this'll electrocute
me or explode, right?

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:02.050
<i>"Hang in there, Tsujimoto!"</i>
<i>"Hang in there, Tsujimoto!"</i>

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:04.350
Just for you, because you
are a fan of the Chief...

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:07.050
...I obtained five voice samples
of the man himself!

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:10.080
What do you think? With this,
you will rise and shine!

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:13.060
Don't break it, okay? It took a
while to make, you know?

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:19.860
I'm not rational like Miyuki! I'll be
blunt; I don't want you to go!

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:23.340
Aw, it's okay! I will be back,
so be a good girl, okay?

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:33.620
"Letter of Recommendation"

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:44.120
You can't even balance for 10 seconds?!
What're you gonna do?!

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:48.500
Tsujimoto! You can get
off the plank now.

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:49.960
What?!

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:52.630
You're holding up
the whole line!

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:53.700
Riiight...

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:00.080
Hey!

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:00.710
Hey!
Huh?

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:00.850
Huh?

00:12:00.850 --> 00:12:02.440
Listen, Tsujimoto...
Huh?

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:06.140
The others are here to learn how
to control their motorcycles.

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:10.210
You, on the other hand, ought to learn
how to control yourself! Got that?!

00:12:10.490 --> 00:12:12.420
Eeeeuuuuuuh!

00:12:12.590 --> 00:12:15.560
This is Patrol School. We don't "Eeuuh"
here. It's "Yes, Sir!" Got that?!

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:18.500
Yessir...

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:28.870
Don't let him get to you... You've
got natural talent, Tsujimoto.

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.840
But, for some reason, I'm not
so confident anymore...

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:33.270
Let's hang in there!

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:35.810
Yeah... I guess...

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:50.490
Uh-oh!

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:53.590
We've got to get going soon,
Nats... I mean, Yoriko!

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:56.000
Right...

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:08.780
Do you think Natsumi's
staying healthy?

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:11.470
Yeah. I'm pretty sure.
Are you worried?

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:13.170
You think she's
doing well?

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:15.180
Of course. It's Natsumi we're
talking about, you know?

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:16.580
What about you,
Miyuki?

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:18.810
Are you doing
all right?

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:22.120
Well, I hope I'm doing as
good a job as she is.

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:45.410
<i>"What's wrong, Tsujimoto?"</i>
<i>"What's wrong, Tsujimoto?"</i>

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:51.410
Riiight, Chief... I'm
hangin' in there...

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:13.340
Where are your
manners?!

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:16.900
You won't get away
from me!

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:23.580
The guy's crazy!

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:28.850
Oh, no! Natsumi! Your
Foot Brakes!

00:14:29.030 --> 00:14:30.990
I can't do anything
like that!

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:53.550
What's the matter? Aren't
you going inside?

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:56.420
Ha ha... for some reason, I'm
kinda embarrassed to!

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:57.790
Is today your day off?

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:58.760
Is today your day off?
Yes.

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:00.720
They've decided to let me make
my debut as a Trooper...

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:03.320
...so I guess I'm here to let you know,
or maybe just to say hello.

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:05.660
Oh! That's great,
isn't it?!

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:07.800
Yeah, well, I guess.

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:11.070
Well, come in!

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:13.330
And... Howdy!

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:16.070
Umm... Natsumi?

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:17.140
Lookin' good!

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:17.610
Sure is!

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:20.040
Sure could use your
help around here...

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:24.170
The cafeteria lady was saying that sales
are way down since you left!

00:15:25.350 --> 00:15:27.340
Where's Miyuki? Is she
in the garage again?

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:38.600
Well...

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:55.140
Tsujimoto!

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:57.280
How is she?

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:09.250
The way I look at it, the damage
could have been much worse.

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:10.220
Yeah.

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:13.730
Still, I guess I'm still not used to
being without you, Natsumi...

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:15.800
Well, you live and learn.

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:20.660
Hey... maybe I should
come back here.

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:21.670
What?!

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:24.000
Ha ha!

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:25.800
W... What are you
talking about?!

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:29.140
It's not like you, Natsumi, to quit
after deciding to do something!

00:16:29.310 --> 00:16:30.340
R... Right.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:33.240
Y... Yeah! Besides, aren't you gonna
be riding escort for the marathon?

00:16:33.350 --> 00:16:36.180
Well, that's terrific! You've got
to go and strut your stuff!

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:38.620
Well, it's only a half-marathon...

00:16:39.020 --> 00:16:42.480
I just don't understand why
you're acting so wimpy...

00:16:42.590 --> 00:16:45.460
...when I've been trying to be as
strong as you always were...

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:55.530
WHY, YOU!

00:16:58.010 --> 00:16:59.980
Sob!

00:17:21.570 --> 00:17:23.190
What're you doing with
the Moto-Compo?!

00:17:23.300 --> 00:17:24.930
Weren't you talking things over
with Tsujimoto just now?

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:27.770
I thought that I'd put it away
in the warehouse.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:30.410
Put it away?! Why would
you want to do that?!

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:33.870
Wait... What happened?!

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:37.040
Natsumi was saying... that
she might come back.

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:38.110
What?

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:39.370
Because I wasn't...

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:42.940
Because I wasn't strong enough,
I made her say such a thing...

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:44.580
That's not true!

00:17:44.760 --> 00:17:45.920
'Cause...

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:49.520
...for her to say such a thing,
it must be the case!

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:54.430
I haven't had the strength to try to
get used to being without her.

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:02.860
You don't need to put the bike away.
There's no reason to put it away...

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:15.980
"Bokuto District Half-Marathon
Grand Prix"

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:20.520
As you can see, the course
follows a 21km path.

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:24.990
Our station will be responsible for
regulating traffic in the vicinity.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.090
We can expect that traffic will
be heavily congested.

00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:29.220
This won't be a cakewalk, so be
prepared... and good luck!

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:30.490
Aye, Sir!

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:31.830
Let's get rolling!

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:40.110
Starting gun in 20 seconds.

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:47.550
Finally. Let's relax and
enjoy ourselves.

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:50.190
I already made a pitstop,
so I'm hunky-dory!

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:51.550
10 seconds...

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:54.410
On your marks...

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:14.240
We're sorry, but this route
will be closed until 3 P. M!

00:19:14.850 --> 00:19:16.710
There she is!

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:18.350
She's here! She's here!

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:20.480
Natsumi! Over here!

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:23.620
I'm the Old Man!

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:24.460
I'm the Tanuki!

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:25.560
Old Lady here!

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:26.620
Soup!

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:27.250
Bunny!

00:19:27.420 --> 00:19:31.450
Rocky Mountain!

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:37.830
Sheesh! That was it?!

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.990
Mega-boring!

00:19:54.350 --> 00:19:57.980
That's weird... Out
of gas already?!

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:16.440
<i>Tsujimoto, you're going too fast!</i>

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:18.600
Oops!

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:20.170
Yoriko, hurry!

00:20:20.340 --> 00:20:21.440
What is it?! What's
going on?

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:25.610
A vehicle on fire! And it couldn't
have happened at a worse time!

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:30.150
What the hell do you
think you're doing?!

00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:31.190
Back up, man!

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:34.020
Can't you see that's dangerous?!

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:37.460
There it is!

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:38.430
Radio for assistance!

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:40.500
I'll try to re-direct the cars!

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:45.120
Please back up slowly! Don't rush!
Back up slowly!

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:47.170
Your cooperation is greatly
appreciated!

00:20:47.340 --> 00:20:49.310
Say what? I can't
hear you very well.

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:51.070
In flames?! A truck?!

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:53.510
Yoriko, calm down and
give me the location!

00:20:53.610 --> 00:20:55.510
Okay, gotcha! I'll be
right there!

00:21:03.090 --> 00:21:05.420
Stay on top on what's happening
on the streets.

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:07.050
We must keep the spectators
from panicking.

00:21:07.220 --> 00:21:09.020
Roger!

00:21:10.890 --> 00:21:14.020
We may have a problem here...

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:18.890
A fire?! At a time
like this?!

00:21:19.070 --> 00:21:21.040
Hold a sec... Lemme check
it out with Headquarters!

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:25.470
Miyuki! Over here!

00:21:27.380 --> 00:21:29.940
Gee! At a time like this, if Natsumi
were here, she'd just...

00:21:30.110 --> 00:21:32.050
NO WAY!

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:33.910
But...

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:36.050
Sorry...

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:37.950
We've got to hurry!

00:21:38.120 --> 00:21:39.020
What're you gonna do?

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:41.050
What're you gonna do?
I'm getting the car!

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:43.190
Don't tell me...

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:47.730
I knew it!

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:54.930
In this kind of situation, who cares
about a few dents and scratches?

00:22:00.940 --> 00:22:04.440
Anyone injured? And how many
officers are en route?

00:22:05.480 --> 00:22:06.180
They cut me off!

00:22:06.180 --> 00:22:07.840
They cut me off!
Tsujimoto... your face!

00:22:08.450 --> 00:22:10.510
We escorts shouldn't look
like we're in a bad mood!

00:22:12.260 --> 00:22:14.220
How 'bout this?!

00:22:22.330 --> 00:22:24.060
Yo, Yoriko, how's
it going?

00:22:24.230 --> 00:22:28.570
Nakajima! The fire trucks can't get
here because of all the cars!

00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:32.440
Damn! We won't be able to do anything
to stop this kind of fire!

00:22:33.580 --> 00:22:35.550
Damn! Hold your breath!

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:40.410
Gotta retreat for
the time being!

00:22:44.550 --> 00:22:47.390
To the Kitten with a Beautiful
Smile... This is the Fox.

00:22:53.630 --> 00:22:56.390
H... Hold on! How on Earth
do you know all this?

00:22:56.770 --> 00:22:59.360
I've told you what
I know.

00:22:59.470 --> 00:23:02.400
The rest is up to you.
I wish you the best.

00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:04.770
What's wrong?

00:23:04.940 --> 00:23:06.170
I'm sorry...

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:08.240
...but please handle things
from here on!

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:13.750
Tsujimoto!

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:21.450
Aw, just when we were
able to see her...

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:27.400
It's Natsumi!

00:23:27.560 --> 00:23:32.130
Natsumi!
Bye-bye!

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:36.170
Natsumi! Cool! Awesome!

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:42.210
Yoriko... How are
you doing?

00:23:42.380 --> 00:23:44.610
I'm not dead yet.

00:23:44.780 --> 00:23:49.340
We took care of moving the cars.
Now all we need is a fire truck.

00:23:49.520 --> 00:23:52.180
Thanks. I owe you
another one...

00:23:55.990 --> 00:23:58.430
Kobayakawa, Nakajima...
Well done.

00:23:58.530 --> 00:24:00.460
The fire truck should
arrive very soon.

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:02.560
What about the Marathon?

00:24:02.730 --> 00:24:04.500
<i>It's running smoothly.</i>

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:06.640
Thank goodness.

00:24:10.140 --> 00:24:14.200
Like I've told you already, the road's
blocked off; I can't get through!

00:24:14.310 --> 00:24:16.340
Look, you aren't the only one
inconvenienced by this!

00:24:16.510 --> 00:24:18.480
Oh... Nakajima!

00:24:18.650 --> 00:24:20.710
Wh... What the?!

00:24:24.550 --> 00:24:26.550
Yoriko! Put your
seat belt on!

00:24:26.720 --> 00:24:28.690
What is it? What's
goin' on?!

00:24:34.730 --> 00:24:36.460
It doesn't look like Nakajima
can get in there!

00:24:36.630 --> 00:24:37.700
We've got to do something!

00:24:37.700 --> 00:24:39.030
We've got to do something!
Oh!

00:24:39.200 --> 00:24:40.000
Natsumi!

00:24:40.100 --> 00:24:42.260
Let's stop that thing NOW!

00:24:48.910 --> 00:24:50.280
Tsujimoto!

00:24:55.190 --> 00:24:57.050
This thing is too heavy! We're
not going to stop!

00:24:57.890 --> 00:25:00.050
Natsumi! Put it
in reverse!

00:25:00.220 --> 00:25:01.730
H... How am I supposed to do that?!

00:25:01.730 --> 00:25:03.250
Calm down! I'll tell you how!

00:25:03.530 --> 00:25:06.660
First, apply the side brakes
to lock the rear wheels!

00:25:06.830 --> 00:25:09.260
Gotcha!

00:25:09.500 --> 00:25:11.800
Step on the clutch, then shift
into reverse!

00:25:11.970 --> 00:25:14.660
Step off the clutch... Release
the side brakes...

00:25:14.870 --> 00:25:17.140
...and FLOOR IT!

00:25:19.710 --> 00:25:22.640
Stop, dammit!

00:25:43.400 --> 00:25:45.370
Tsujimoto!

00:25:45.500 --> 00:25:47.090
Hand gesture: "Sorry"

00:25:58.250 --> 00:26:01.120
Sakai... I'd better give
this back to you.

00:26:01.280 --> 00:26:03.410
Eh?

00:26:04.050 --> 00:26:05.210
You're gonna quit,
aren't you?

00:26:05.390 --> 00:26:10.290
I realized that I don't belong on
a fixed route, that's why.

00:26:10.460 --> 00:26:11.620
A perfect 10!

00:26:11.800 --> 00:26:12.730
Huh?

00:26:12.900 --> 00:26:15.060
Your smile was excellent!

00:26:15.170 --> 00:26:17.130
That was the best I've
ever seen you make!

00:26:37.150 --> 00:26:38.450
You sure about this?

00:26:38.620 --> 00:26:40.420
You're the one
who told me...

00:26:40.520 --> 00:26:42.050
"Chances like this come to you
only if you make them...

00:26:42.230 --> 00:26:44.720
"...and you have to make the best of
them when you get them." Right?

00:26:46.600 --> 00:26:48.260
So I hear she pulled yet another
impulsive stunt, huh?

00:26:48.430 --> 00:26:49.830
It's so like her.

00:26:58.610 --> 00:27:01.100
Yo! Is the seat next
to you taken?

00:27:03.710 --> 00:27:06.080
Yo, girlfriend, could I
hitch a ride wit'cha?

00:27:08.250 --> 00:27:10.220
Miyuki?

00:27:13.660 --> 00:27:14.950
Silly!

00:27:15.130 --> 00:27:18.690
Yup! That's me!

00:28:16.950 --> 00:28:25.300
<i>I love the smile you always have.</i>
<i>With all the passion I have...</i>

00:28:25.360 --> 00:28:34.700
<i>...I will protect you from sighs.</i>

00:28:34.800 --> 00:28:42.550
<i>The sunset skyline flashes past</i>
<i>in my side-view mirror.</i>

00:28:42.550 --> 00:28:42.710
<i>The sunset skyline flashes past</i>

00:28:42.780 --> 00:28:50.280
<i>This is the road I drive on every day,</i>
<i>believing in my dreams.</i>

00:28:50.390 --> 00:28:58.190
<i>On rainy days, windy days, and days</i>
<i>when I wanted to throw it all away...</i>

00:28:58.300 --> 00:29:02.500
<i>... you smiled as you</i>
<i>sat beside me.</i>

00:29:02.500 --> 00:29:05.960
<i>... you smiled as you</i>

00:29:07.240 --> 00:29:15.550
<i>I love the unchanging vista, the sky</i>
<i>that we watch together.</i>

00:29:15.610 --> 00:29:22.550
<i>That's why I'm confident that I can</i>
<i>hang in there, if it's for you.</i>

00:29:22.620 --> 00:29:31.020
<i>I love the smile you always have.</i>
<i>With all the passion I have...</i>

00:29:31.130 --> 00:29:36.170
<i>...I will protect you from sighs.</i>

00:29:36.230 --> 00:29:36.430
<i>I love this town where we</i>

00:29:41.370 --> 00:29:45.070
THE END
